# What the rust-browser CI image's build may see of the checkout.
#
# An allowlist, for the reasons rust.Dockerfile.dockerignore gives: the context
# is the scripts this image installs and nothing else, and BuildKit reads this
# file in preference to the root .dockerignore, whose allowlist is written for
# the images under deployments/ and would hide every COPY source below.
#
# The paths are the COPY sources of rust-browser.Dockerfile. Everything the Rust
# image copies is in the base image already, so none of it is here.

*
!/.devcontainer/languages/node
!/scripts/ci/install-playwright-chromium.sh
